#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.0.rst:2
msgid "Version 4.2.0"
msgstr "버전 4.2.0"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.0.rst:4
msgid "Release Date: June 3, 2022"
msgstr "릴리즈 날짜: 2022년 6월 3일"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.0.rst:6
msgid "**4.2.0 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr "**CodeIgniter4\ 의 4.2.0 릴리즈**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.0.rst:13
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "주요 사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.0.rst:15 ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.0.rst:141
msgid "Update minimal PHP requirement to 7.4."
msgstr "최소 PHP 요구 사항이 7.4로 업데이트되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.0.rst:16 ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.0.rst:142
msgid ""
"To make the default configuration more secure, auto-routing has been "
"changed to disabled by default."
msgstr "기본 설정을 더 안전하게 만들기 위해 자동 라우팅이 기본적으로 비활성화되도록 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.0.rst:17
msgid ""
"**OCI8 Driver for Oracle Database** (*contributed by* `ytetsuro "
"<https://github.com/ytetsuro>`_). See `Database`_."
msgstr "**Oracle Database용 OCI8 드라이버** (*기여: `ytetsuro <https://github.com/ytetsuro>`_*). `Database`_\ 를 참조하십시오."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.0.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Improved Auto Routing** (opt-in) (*contributed by* `kenjis "
"<https://github.com/kenjis>`_). See `New Improved Auto Routing`_."
msgstr "**개선된 자동 라우팅** (선택 사용) (*기여: `kenjis <https://github.com/kenjis>`_*). `새로운 개선된 자동 라우팅`_\ 을 참조하십시오."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.0.rst:19
msgid ""
"Query Builder **Subqueries** and **UNION** support (*contributed by* "
"`Andrey Pyzhikov <https://github.com/iRedds>`_). See `Database`_."
msgstr "Query Builder의 **서브쿼리** 및 **UNION** 지원 (*기여: `Andrey Pyzhikov <https://github.com/iRedds>`_*). `Database`_\ 를 참조하십시오."

